---
const links = [
  { href: 'mailto:amiteshrai@outlook.com', label: 'email' },
  { href: 'https://linkedin.com/in/amiteshkumarrai', label: 'linkedin' },
  { href: 'https://github.com/amiteshrai', label: 'github' },
];
---

<section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-border py-10">
  <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">Get in touch</p>
  <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">
    Have a data platform that can't show its work, a forecast you can't defend, or an AI agent
    that won't leave the sandbox? That's my kind of problem. If it's one of yours, let's talk:
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4 font-mono text-sm">
    {links.map((l) => <a href={l.href} class="text-accent hover:underline">{l.label}</a>)}
  </div>
</section>
